sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin as "Admin"
    participant UI as "Interface: UI"
    participant API as "mainController: Controller"
    participant App as "applicationService: Service"
    participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
    Admin->>UI: Create/update/move/delete category
    UI->>+API: POST/PUT/DELETE /api/v1/categories
    API->>App: Validate parent and authorization
    App->>DB: Check circular relation and dependent products/children
    alt Valid change
        App->>DB: Persist category tree and audit
        API-->>-UI: Updated category tree
    else Circular relation or dependency exists
        API-->>UI: 400/409 error
    end


